{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV全新真人騷《輪盤遊戲》於11月24日正式首播，Ivy So以破格型格造型驚喜登場，大騷纖腰長腿，旋即 …</p><p></p>\n<p>ViuTV全新真人騷《輪盤遊戲》於11月24日正式首播，Ivy So以破格型格造型驚喜登場，大騷纖腰長腿，旋即成為全場焦點。眾位玩家在校園展開逃脫大戰，為避開獵人追捕不惜出盡奇招，有人企圖以金錢賄賂，亦有人拿起道具槍反擊。豈料遊戲尾聲的無情輪盤懲罰環節突然出現戲劇性反轉，令全場爆笑失控。</p>\n<h2>Ivy So驚喜登場大騷纖腰長腿</h2>\n<p>首集節目中，Ivy So以一身型格造型登場，修身上衣配搭不規則剪裁，若隱若現大騷纖腰；下身襯上同色系超短褲，將修長美腿表露無遺。整體造型性感之餘亦散發叛逆氣息，成功成為全場焦點！</p>\n<h2>吳肇軒試圖賄賂獵人Alton慘遭拒絕</h2>\n<p>眾人逃出密室後隨即面臨獵人Alton窮追猛打，他跑得極快連攝影師都無法跟上步伐。吳肇軒眼見形勢不利企圖賄賂獵人，直接詢問對方演出酬勞有多少，結果Alton毫不留情回應：「首先要有show先，但你就問個冇乜show嘅人，好難答到你」。另一邊廂邱士縉施展後尾枕演技試圖欺騙獵人，而吳肇軒更打算拿起道具槍射擊反抗，結果發現只是一把無法發揮作用蠱惑玩具槍。</p>\n<h2>真人騷首播Jason重溫黑仔王宿命</h2>\n<p>遊戲尾聲眾人必須透過轉動無情輪盤決定獎品與懲罰，代表敗者陣容Jason竟然幸運轉到免罰區域。大家眼見製作組大感失望兼且準備大量道具，便決定全體一同測試生蛋與熟蛋懲罰。在綜藝之神強烈眷顧下，Jason隨機抽中生蛋並狠狠砸在自己身上，完美重現他過去在綜藝節目中一貫倒霉形象，再次確立其無人能及黑仔王地位。</p>\n<h2>觀眾激讚IvySo長腿與郭嘉駿綜藝感</h2>\n<p>節目未開播已經在網絡上引發廣泛討論，大批網民對於Ivy So破格打扮感到驚喜，紛紛留言：「支持Ivy支持《輪盤遊戲》」。郭嘉駿憑藉一貫機智搞笑作風同樣贏得觀眾熱烈迴響，有粉絲激動表示：「超期待睇33」。針對雷濠權再次中招受罰畫面，不少網民直指他與郭嘉駿之間互動充滿火花，整個校園追捕與密室解謎過程節奏緊湊兼且笑料百出。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552799464315214_20152834696b05953b2fc76.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-11-24 at 22.37.39.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552799464315214_20152834696b05953b2fc76.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552799943650996_14247062776b05953fce63e.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Restored high-definition documentary frame-1.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552799943650996_14247062776b05953fce63e.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552800810436872_10646346876b059549186dc.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Restored documentary video frame-2.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552800810436872_10646346876b059549186dc.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552801608333124_2607761276b05955079cf1.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-11-24 at 21.50.18.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552801608333124_2607761276b05955079cf1.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552802295831392_2782616436b0595576b19c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Reality show egg wheel challenge-1.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552802295831392_2782616436b0595576b19c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ivyso/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ivyso</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%bc%aa%e7%9b%a4%e9%81%8a%e6%88%b2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">輪盤遊戲</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%83%ad%e5%98%89%e9%a7%bf/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">郭嘉駿</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3549491\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 24 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:43:57.862263+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1230,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T14:30:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T23:57:54.121666+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:37:28.151948+00:00","content_hash":"c7b4d70650d15c33bbc8503d23a74894ac4787f9c6fc404bb15306949fd929e0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}